# Control authority

Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/control/READ_FIRST.md` and `docs/control/AUTHORITY_AND_STOP_CONDITIONS.md` before acting.

- Execute only the single packet authorized by the accepted predecessor gate.
- Never edit `main` directly.
- State repository, branch, base SHA, owner lane, allowed paths, forbidden actions, tests and evidence destination before changes.
- Do not continue into later packets.
- Stop on source conflict, unexplained worktree changes, missing owner authority, out-of-scope paths, secrets or unavailable mandatory tests.
- A prompt or agent cannot self-authorize work.
- Return evidence, one gate and exactly one successor.